    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Star Aquarium is a fish-raising game that accompanies you in work and study. You can buy cute little fish, collect and feed them. Adult fish will drop stars every minute. Stars can be used to buy various other fish, or you can buy capsules to get rare species. When you are working, relaxing and entertaining, cute little fish swim around on your desktop, which is relaxing and healing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705Feed the fish and make it grow! Click on the fish to pop out cute bubbles! You can also click and drag the fish to make it swim anywhere on the screen!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703090/extras/14e82cae3dc2a5c46180af72705cad24.poster.avif?t=1750329924\" width=502 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703090/extras/14e82cae3dc2a5c46180af72705cad24.webm?t=1750329924\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703090/extras/14e82cae3dc2a5c46180af72705cad24.mp4?t=1750329924\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705Unlock dozens of cute little fish. Different little fish can also trigger bonds, gain buffs, and get more benefits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703090/extras/4ecf925392f740f4d8c31d293391a0db.avif?t=1750329924\" width=600 height=244 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705A variety of decorations and activities! Purchase and deploy decorations, hold various unique activities, and improve the mood of fish! Fish with improved mood can get more benefits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703090/extras/4f7268a0bc290a5b1f0b3f4b3dbfcb80.avif?t=1750329924\" width=482 height=282 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705You can freely set the fish's activity range on the screen! When working, lower the setting and the fish will only swim at the bottom! When relaxing, raise the setting and the fish can swim freely across the entire screen!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703090/extras/3e0cfd6ce794ef12bf8fe838e7ac558b.avif?t=1750329924\" data-has-big width=800 height=576 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let\u2019s raise cute little fish on the screen!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Star Aquarium is a fish-raising game that accompanies you in work and study. You can buy cute little fish, collect and feed them. Adult fish will drop stars every minute. Stars can be used to buy various other fish, or you can buy capsules to get rare species. When you are working, relaxing and entertaining, cute little fish swim around on your desktop, which is relaxing and healing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705Feed the fish and make it grow! Click on the fish to pop out cute bubbles! You can also click and drag the fish to make it swim anywhere on the screen!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703090/extras/14e82cae3dc2a5c46180af72705cad24.poster.avif?t=1750329924\" width=502 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703090/extras/14e82cae3dc2a5c46180af72705cad24.webm?t=1750329924\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703090/extras/14e82cae3dc2a5c46180af72705cad24.mp4?t=1750329924\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705Unlock dozens of cute little fish. Different little fish can also trigger bonds, gain buffs, and get more benefits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703090/extras/4ecf925392f740f4d8c31d293391a0db.avif?t=1750329924\" width=600 height=244 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705A variety of decorations and activities! Purchase and deploy decorations, hold various unique activities, and improve the mood of fish! Fish with improved mood can get more benefits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703090/extras/4f7268a0bc290a5b1f0b3f4b3dbfcb80.avif?t=1750329924\" width=482 height=282 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705You can freely set the fish's activity range on the screen! When working, lower the setting and the fish will only swim at the bottom! When relaxing, raise the setting and the fish can swim freely across the entire screen!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703090/extras/3e0cfd6ce794ef12bf8fe838e7ac558b.avif?t=1750329924\" data-has-big width=800 height=576 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let\u2019s raise cute little fish on the screen!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "This is a group of cute little fish swimming leisurely at the bottom of the screen while you work. The fish swim, grow and earn stars for you. Use them to buy other cute little fish until the bottom of the screen becomes a colorful ocean world! Start a leisure desktop fish farming journey!",
